// Q-025 db.open with a relative path opens it in the program's folder, and does not say where
// mode: serve
// get: /
// fixed-when: /q025\.db/
// From FEEDBACK2.md §10 (found on 896e758): PM_DB=pm.db, run from another folder, wrote to the program's own database.

db.open(env("Q025_DB", "q025.db"))

route GET / = "ok"
